WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.700
Are you an entrepreneur, a consultant or a freelancer?

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.300
You have a thousand things to manage:

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:09.300
clients, projects, appointments…

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.900
and it all still relies on your memory?

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:17.500
A single slip can cost you
an appointment, an opportunity or a payment.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:22.800
Meet Remind Me, your personal assistant,
which brings all your activities together.

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:27.300
Your tasks, your calendar and your appointments
are gathered in one place,

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:32.200
and Remind Me alerts you at the right moment,
wherever you are, at any time.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:36.340
Online or not, you get a smart voice reminder
and regular notifications

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:40.400
that support you in organizing
your professional and personal life.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.400
Nothing slips past you anymore.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:48.600
By the way, do you really know what comes in,
what goes out and what's left of your finances?

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:52.000
Remind Me gives you a clear view
of your expected income,

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:55.860
your payments received, your net balance
and your scheduled expenses,

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.900
and reminds you out loud.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:01.600
And meanwhile, your goals move forward, step by step.

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:06.800
With Remind Me, your work, your time,
your money… finally under control.

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:09.500
Start for free!
